{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39241","headline":"婺州屏居蒙右省王拾遗车枉降访病中延候不得因成寄谢 · 韦庄","name":"婺州屏居蒙右省王拾遗车枉降访病中延候不得因成寄谢","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三年流落卧漳滨，王粲思家拭泪频。\n画角莫吹残月夜，病心方忆故园春。\n自爲江上樵苏客，不识天边侍从臣。\n怪得白鸥惊去尽，绿萝门外有朱轮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦庄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39241.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39241","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}